NOTE
Disc 2, Scene 05h: Lunatic Pandora interior — wide view of core
Duration: ~7 seconds
Source: FF8 FMV

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Wide view of the crystal core chamber. A towering machine with circuit-etched panels rises from the floor, radial arms spread like petals.

